# CR 613.8a: Andrios ("tapped creatures you control with base power and
# toughness 4/3 have base power and toughness 16/9") depends on Nirkana's
# level 1-2 static (base 4/3): applied first, Nirkana's makes Andrios apply
# to Nirkana too (GameAction.findStaticAbilityToApply, the Affected$ leg,
# GameAction.java:1353-1356). CR 613.8 then has Andrios's 16/9 apply last;
# Java keeps Layer 7b values in a table ordered by timestamp (Card.newPT,
# Card.java:288, getCurrentPower takes the last), so Nirkana's later 4/3
# wins and it stays 4/3. Reproduced (quirks.md, forge-java-defects.md):
# Andrios deals 16, Nirkana 4.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
